From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 13:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 108/108] PC5: the touchpad's halves, swipes, two-finger click and
 pointer with keyboard and mouse

With mode = keyboard the touchpad was one button. [input] touchpad_mode
now makes it button (as before), zones (a click on its left or right half
and a quick swipe up, down, left or right are buttons of their own, and
the touchpad button sends nothing) or mouse (a finger moves the pointer
by one and a half pixels for each of the touchpad's; the click is still
the touchpad button's). two_finger binds a click with two fingers in any
of them, and quiets the touchpad button for it; left unbound, the title
may take it for its own (PC5's on-screen keyboard).
---
